A '''Rosewater Flask''' is a {{Rare}} item that increases the {{DarkGreen|Growth Stage}} of crops in the [[Greenhouse]]. After reaching {{Green|4}} bonus {{DarkGreen|Growth Stages}}, it evolves into a '''Filled Rosewater Flask'''.

