== Usage ==
Upon reaching {{Green|4}} bonus {{DarkGreen|Growth Stage}}, a '''Rosewater Flask''' evolves into a '''Filled Rosewater Flask''' with the following message:

{{Dialogue|&d&lEVOLUTION! &dYour &9Rosewater Flask &dhas evolved!}}

Consuming a '''Filled Rosewater Flask''' increases the {{DarkGreen|Growth Stage}} of crops in the [[Greenhouse]] plot the player is standing in by {{Green|4}}. It also grants a permanent {{stat|fmf|1}}. The permanent buff can only be gained {{Green|5}} times.

It gains {{Green|1}} {{DarkGreen|Growth Stage}} every {{Green|75 hours}}, taking {{Green|300 hours}} to reach the maximum buff of {{Green|4}} bonus {{DarkGreen|Growth Stages}}. A '''Rosewater Flask''' ages twice as fast if placed in a [[Time Pocket]].

After consuming a '''Rosewater Flask''' or '''Filled Rosewater Flask''', there is a co-op wide {{Green|2}} hour cooldown before another one can be used.

== Notes ==
*Unlike other items, '''Rosewater Flasks''' cannot be progressed via [[Catacombs Puzzle Rooms#Quiz|Oruo]]'s Blessing of Time. However, they still age twice as fast in the [[Time Pocket]].
*[[Cheesebite]]s do not grow past the next rat-spawn stage; a stage 3 [[Cheesebite]] will become a stage 4 [[Cheesebite]] instead of a stage 7 [[Cheesebite]].

